## Claude-specific notes

Anything below applies **only** to Claude Code. If a rule applies to every agent, it belongs in
`AGENTS.md` instead.

- Run `/code-review` **and** `/security-review` as the independent second pass required by the
  `codereview` skill (Step −1). In `solo` mode they are the only second opinion that exists.
- `/gates` · `/pre-flight` · `/honesty` · `/execute-plan` are available as slash commands.
- Subagents live in `.claude/agents/`; the delegation workflow is
  `.claude/workflows/parallel-implementation.md`.

